<div class="guide-styles" data-ay-injected="true" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Arcane Mage DPS in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 4. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the Titan Rune Dungeons currency loot (Sidereal and Defiler's Scourgestones).<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Arcane Mage DPS Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>In phase 4 we now have access to great new gear, both in the form of crafted gear that is available with <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=49908/primordial-saronite">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_felflamebreath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Primordial Saronite</span></a> which we can farm using the new Gamma Heroic currency (the Defiler's Scourgestones), as well as <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4722/trial-of-the-crusader">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Trial of the Crusader</span></a> 25-Man Normal items which we can now farm using the previously mentioned Heroic Gamma difficulty. <br/>
<br/>This combined with even easier to farm <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=2589/sidereal-essence">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_icediamond_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sidereal Essence</span></span></a> since you can obtain them from the Defiler's Scourgestone Vendor means that not only can we obtain new items a lot easier, but also makes it easier to obtain old <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4273/ulduar">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Ulduar</span></a> 10-Man Hard Mode items.<ol>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Hit </b>- Aim for 8% Hit Rating, because with the <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=12840/arcane-focus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_devotion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Focus</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=29440/precision">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_ice_magicdamage.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Precision</span></a> and <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33193/misery">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_shadow_misery.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Misery</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=33602/improved-faerie-fire">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_nature_faeriefire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Improved Faerie Fire</span></a> you'll be Hit Capped at 17%</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Spell Power</b> - Having higher spell power will increase the damage of the spells themselves.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Haste Rating</b> - Will increase the total amount of casts per fight.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<b>Critical Strike Rating</b> - Increases the chance to critically hit spells, which are improved further by <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=35581/spell-power">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_arcane_arcanetorrent.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spell Power</span></a>.</div></li></ol>
