<br/>
<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-bind-on-equip">Best Bind on Equip Items for Arcane Mage DPS - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>Some of these items are crafted, while others are raid drops that happen to be BoE and tradable. Because they can be quite expensive they're listed here as options if you're browsing the auction house for some high value items to upgrade your character faster and enter raids sooner.<br/>
<br/>
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="3" class="grid clean-markup-table-borders" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 20%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Rank</b></td>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 40%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Item</b></td>
<td data-background="c8" style="width: 40%; max-width: 100%;">
<b>Source</b></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>1</td>
<td>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=50182/blood-queens-crimson-choker">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_crimsonspinel_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Blood Queen's Crimson Choker</span></a></td>
<td>
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/npc=37955/blood-queen-lanathel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Blood-Queen Lana'thel</span></a> - <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/zone=4812/icecrown-citadel">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Icecrown Citadel</span></a> 25-Man Normal</td></tr>
<tr>
